      "blocks": {
        "text_jUByfz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Milano, we believe true luxury is about beauty with intention. That’s why we’ve partnered with <a href=\"https://savethewhales.org/\" title=\"https://savethewhales.org/\">SaveTheWhales.org</a>, a respected nonprofit dedicated to protecting the ocean and its magnificent inhabitants through education, and long-term conservation efforts, ensuring that future generations inherit not just memories of the sea, but thriving ecosystems and life beneath the waves. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "image_RAXYiY": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Savethewhales.jpg",
            "image_width": 350,
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "subheading_JXaHAf": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Wear the Ocean. Protect What You Love. "
          }
        },
        "text_hNnGUx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every piece in our Whale Collection is designed not only as a refined expression of sustainable craftsmanship, but also as a reminder of what we stand to protect. With every purchase, 5% of the proceeds are donated directly to support whale conservation, and ocean preservation, so that the elegance you choose today becomes part of a greater legacy tomorrow.<br/></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_qr9FnA": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "WHY WE SAVE THE WHALES"
          }
        },
        "text_DTttYG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whales are more than breathtaking creatures; they play an essential role in maintaining the health of the oceans. From balancing marine ecosystems to capturing carbon in their large bodies, their protection matters for the future of our planet. At the heart of this collaboration is education - inspiring over 370,000 children through hands-on learning, awareness, and nurturing care for the ocean, and its friends.  </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_ngqQpV": {
